  "description": "The Melbourne Recital Centre program explicitly credits Margaret Leng Tan on Schoenhut toy piano for the selected Chen work. The original toy-piano owner only exposes a pop block-chord keyboard technique; this isolated owner preserves its physical type and timbral choices while providing a neutral authored concert approach. The existing owner is not changed. Exact keyboard gestures and preparation are not established by the source.",
